{"version":1,"content":"<p>古天樂（古仔）將於本月21日踏入56歲，昨晚（17日）他舉行派對，與700、800位粉絲一同提早慶生。</p><p>古仔將生日會打造成迷你演唱會，不僅傾力獻唱10多首經典歌曲，更即場重現招牌舞步，掀起全場高潮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T12:58:51.089316+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:30:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T05:57:40.615780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T12:57:36.955234+00:00","content_hash":"9b4a0b5139dbcd580f0fc503d1fcdcae3ae55abe6e0bfddc94ee296f650971de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}